    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: <p>The rapid availability of spare parts is crucial to ensure efficient repair services.<br data-start="128" data-end="131">Odoo must include a spare parts management system that allows <strong>stock levels</strong> to be tracked,<br><strong>replenishments to be automated</strong>, and access to the<strong> required parts</strong> to be guaranteed when repairs are needed.</p><p>Planning <strong>repairs</strong> and services can be complex, especially during peak demand periods.<br data-start="421" data-end="424">Odoo must include advanced planning features to optimize technicians’ time,<br data-start="499" data-end="502">minimize customer waiting times, and ensure an efficient customer service workflow.</p><img width="299" height="168" class="size-full wp-image-1388 aligncenter" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/trott.jpeg" alt="trottinette">
    solutionLabel: THE SOLUTION
    solution: <p>For Freemoov, we implemented a complete and customized ERP solution, including an integrated <strong>eCommerce</strong> website, as well as <strong>task</strong>,<strong> inventory</strong>, <strong>purchasing</strong>, <strong>sales</strong>, and<strong> accounting management</strong>. This centralized platform has enabled Freemoov to streamline operations, improve efficiency, and gain a clear, real-time view of its business.</p>
